{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>When you kindle</b> — the lamps adjoin to Hanukkah, for publicizing the miracle through lamps:" "<b>בהעלתך את</b> — in gematria: make in it stages." "<b>אל מול פני המנורה יאירו</b> — for I do not need its light:" "<b>פני המנורה יאירו</b> — in gematria: do I need your light?" "<b>Seven lamps</b> — corresponding to the seven planets: חנכ\"ל שצ\"ם. It is written 'when you kindle the lamps' and it is written 'to kindle a lamp continually' — for Beit Hillel: lamp, and afterward lamps, for they add and go; and that is 'to kindle a lamp continually' — that one elevates in holiness. And for Beit Shammai: first lamps and afterward lamp, for they diminish and go:" "<b>להעל</b> — ות נר תמיד. ס\"ת: תרד."], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:21:32.797125078Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}